---
---
<section id="depoimentos" class="testimonials">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h2>A confiança de quem já contou com nossa defesa.</h2>
      <div class="google-badge">
        <div class="google-icon">G</div>
        <div class="google-rating">
          <span class="score">5.0</span>
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
        </div>
        <span class="google-text">Google Meu Negócio</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="cards-grid">
      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-glass-shine"></div>
        <div class="card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="quote">Excelente atendimento e clareza dos fatos, sem dúvidas atendeu demais as minhas expectativas.</p>
        <div class="author-info">
          <span class="name">Lucas Almeida</span>
          <span class="context">Avaliação Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-glass-shine"></div>
        <div class="card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="quote">Ótimo atendimento, e excelentes profissionais 👏</p>
        <div class="author-info">
          <span class="name">Daniel Santos</span>
          <span class="context">Avaliação Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-glass-shine"></div>
        <div class="card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="quote">Muito bom trabalho excelente recomendo</p>
        <div class="author-info">
          <span class="name">Tiago Oliveira</span>
          <span class="context">Avaliação Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4 -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-glass-shine"></div>
        <div class="card-stars">★★★★★</div>
        <p class="quote">Um excelente advogado trabalhista</p>
        <div class="author-info">
          <span class="name">Diego Ferreira</span>
          <span class="context">Avaliação Google</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .testimonials {
    background-color: var(--dark, #1a1a1a);
    padding: 5rem 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .testimonials::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(192, 192, 192, 0.12), transparent);
  }
  
  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  
  .header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3.5rem;
  }
  
  .header h2 {
    font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
    color: var(--white, #ffffff);
    font-size: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .google-badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 50px;
    color: var(--white, #ffffff);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  }
  
  .google-icon {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--silver, #c0c0c0);
  }
  
  .google-rating {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .score {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--white, #ffffff);
  }
  
  .stars {
    color: var(--silver, #c0c0c0);
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
  }
  
  .google-text {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  
  .cards-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }
  
  .card {
    position: relative;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.07) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.015) 100%);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem 2rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    overflow: hidden;
    backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px) saturate(180%);
    transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    box-shadow: 
      0 12px 36px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35),
      inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25),
      inset 0 0 16px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02);
  }

  .card-glass-shine {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 45%;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08) 0%, transparent 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
    border-radius: 20px 20px 0 0;
  }

  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-6px);
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.11) 0%, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03) 100%);
    border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.28);
    box-shadow: 
      0 20px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5),
      0 0 30px rgba(192, 192, 192, 0.1),
      inset 0 1px 3px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  }
  
  .card::before {
    content: '"';
    font-size: 5rem;
    color: var(--silver, #c0c0c0);
    opacity: 0.08;
    position: absolute;
    top: -0.5rem;
    left: 1.5rem;
    font-family: serif;
    line-height: 1;
  }
  
  .card-stars {
    color: var(--silver, #c0c0c0);
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    letter-spacing: 2px;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .quote {
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--silver-dark, #8a8a8a);
    line-height: 1.65;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    flex-grow: 1;
    z-index: 1;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  
  .author-info {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  
  .name {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white, #ffffff);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  
  .context {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--silver-dark, #8a8a8a);
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .header h2 {
      font-size: 2.25rem;
    }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .testimonials {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem;
    }

    .cards-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    }
  }
</style>
